//    sub-driver → lever → value line, 40 lines; stakeholder value: four
//    business dimensions → nine improvement areas → themes) and the 893
//    action wordings come from the map's source workbook. Each action
//    carries the value line(s) it sits on (`at`), which is what the value
//    map view crosses.
//  * Generated 2026-09-13 from the prototype's data module with no action
//    wording changed; this file is now the source. An action's
//    `description` is its shareholder-value path, as the prototype showed.
//  * Themes inside an improvement area are marked uniformly in this
//    revision of the workbook, so they are shown as the area's sub-labels
//    and not offered as a filter.
//  * Three of the workbook's 922 rows carry no stakeholder mark and are
//    not on the map: "Rent or lease excess capacity (water
//    infrastructures, warehouses etc.)", "Continuously track and manage
//    the benefits of procurement policies", "Participate in supply chain
//    industry groups".
//
// The `attribution` paragraph below is rendered verbatim on the tool page
// and is for the owner to word.
